# The images under tests/ exist only to prove the dotfiles bootstrap completes
# during `docker build`. They are never run as long-lived containers, so a
# HEALTHCHECK has nothing meaningful to report. Mirrors the equivalent
# checkov:skip=CKV_DOCKER_2 already declared in those Dockerfiles.
AVD-DS-0026

# Trivy reports this against the whole x/crypto module even though gmailctl's
# compiled package graph does not import the unmaintained openpgp package.
# The Go-tool CI job fails if that package ever enters the dependency graph.
GO-2026-5932
